{"id":"a12","level":2,"levelName":"Ulpan Alef","n":12,"of":19,"title":"Bigger, smaller, best","titleHe":"הַשְׁוָאָה","goal":"Compare two things, and pick the top of a set.","sections":[{"type":"text","body":"Hebrew doesn't change the adjective to compare. It puts יוֹתֵר, more, in front of it and מִ, than, in front of what you're comparing to."},{"type":"table","caption":"One adjective, five sentences","head":["English","Hebrew"],"rows":[["big","גָּדוֹל"],["bigger than","יוֹתֵר גָּדוֹל מִ־"],["less big than","פָּחוֹת גָּדוֹל מִ־"],["as big as","גָּדוֹל כְּמוֹ"],["the biggest","הֲכִי גָּדוֹל"],["the biggest — in writing","הַגָּדוֹל בְּיוֹתֵר"]]},{"type":"tip","body":"יוֹתֵר can also follow the adjective — גָּדוֹל יוֹתֵר — with no change of meaning. הֲכִי is what people say; הַ־ plus בְּיוֹתֵר is what they write."},{"type":"text","body":"The מִ of than is the same מִ you learned for from, and like every Hebrew preposition it takes endings rather than standing before a pronoun."},{"type":"table","caption":"מִן with endings","head":["","form"],"rows":[["than me","מִמֶּנִּי"],["than you (m.)","מִמְּךָ"],["than you (f.)","מִמֵּךְ"],["than him / than it","מִמֶּנּוּ"],["than her","מִמֶּנָּה"],["than us","מֵאִתָּנוּ"],["than them","מֵהֶם"]]},{"type":"examples","items":[{"he":"הַסֵּפֶר הַזֶּה יוֹתֵר טוֹב.","en":"This book is better."},{"he":"הִיא יוֹתֵר גְּבוֹהָה מִמֶּנִּי.","en":"She is taller than me."},{"he":"אֲנִי לֹא גָּבוֹהַּ כְּמוֹ אַבָּא.","en":"I'm not as tall as Dad."},{"he":"זֶה הַסֵּפֶר הֲכִי טוֹב.","en":"This is the best book."}]}],"vocab":[{"he":"מִמֶּנִּי","en":"than me, from me","translit":"mimeni"},{"he":"מִמְּךָ","en":"than you (m.)","translit":"mimcha"},{"he":"מִמֶּנּוּ","en":"than him, than it","translit":"mimenu"},{"he":"מִמֶּנָּה","en":"than her","translit":"mimena"},{"he":"מֵהֶם","en":"than them","translit":"mehem"},{"he":"יוֹתֵר","en":"more","translit":"yoter"},{"he":"פָּחוֹת","en":"less","translit":"pachot"},{"he":"הֲכִי","en":"the most (spoken)","translit":"hachi"},{"he":"כְּמוֹ","en":"like, as","translit":"kmo"},{"he":"כָּל כָּךְ","en":"so, so much","translit":"kol kach"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["belief, faith","than me, from me","telephone","lamp"],"correct":1,"prompt":"מִמֶּנִּי","translit":"mimeni"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["generally","than you (m.)","homeland","looked at"],"correct":1,"prompt":"מִמְּךָ","translit":"mimcha"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["it is worth it","blue","than him, than it","kingdom"],"correct":2,"prompt":"מִמֶּנּוּ","translit":"mimenu"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["heavy","than her","wall","that (m.)"],"correct":1,"prompt":"מִמֶּנָּה","translit":"mimena"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["influence","boring","this (f.)","than them"],"correct":3,"prompt":"מֵהֶם","translit":"mehem"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["is located, is found","more","ten (f.)","gives"],"correct":1,"prompt":"יוֹתֵר","translit":"yoter"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["orange","rabbi, great","less","meat"],"correct":2,"prompt":"פָּחוֹת","translit":"pachot"},{"type":"listen","q":"Which word did you hear?","options":["מִמֶּנִּי","מִמֶּנּוּ","הֲכִי","פָּחוֹת"],"correct":2,"say":"הֲכִי","he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"One adjective, five sentences — big?","options":["גָּדוֹל","פָּחוֹת גָּדוֹל מִ־","יוֹתֵר גָּדוֹל מִ־","גָּדוֹל כְּמוֹ"],"correct":0,"he":true},{"type":"read","he":"מִמְּךָ","translit":"mimcha","en":"than you (m.)"},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “like, as”?","options":["חָכְמָה","כְּמוֹ","תֵּכֶף","תָּכְנָה"],"correct":1,"he":true},{"type":"cloze","sentence":"זֶה ___ הֲכִי טוֹב.","en":"This is the best book.","options":["יוֹתֵר","הַסֵּפֶר","מִמֶּנִּי","מִמֶּנָּה"],"correct":1,"full":"זֶה הַסֵּפֶר הֲכִי טוֹב."},{"type":"choice","q":"than him / than it?","options":["מִמֵּךְ","מִמֶּנִּי","מִמֶּנּוּ","מִמְּךָ"],"correct":2,"he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “less”?","options":["סֻכּוֹת","מַהְפֵּכָה","זָקֵן","פָּחוֹת"],"correct":3,"he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"than you (f.)?","options":["מִמֶּנּוּ","מִמֵּךְ","מִמְּךָ","מִמֶּנִּי"],"correct":1,"he":true},{"type":"type","q":"Write “more” in Hebrew","answer":"יוֹתֵר","hint":"yoter"}]}